            "GA4 standard reports carry a processing delay, typically 24–48 hours; only ga_get_realtime_report reflects the current minute.",
            "GA4 applies sampling to large or high-cardinality queries and collapses high-cardinality dimension values into (other), so totals may not reconcile across reports.",
            "The Data API enforces per-property token quotas (per day, per hour, and concurrent requests). Broad generic reports can exhaust them; the server does not meter or back off.",
